{:itonami.blueprint/id "cloud-itonami-isic-2733"
 :itonami.blueprint/name "Manufacture of wiring devices"
 :itonami.blueprint/isic-rev5 "2733"
 :itonami.blueprint/domain :electrical-equipment/manufacturing
 :itonami.blueprint/license "AGPL-3.0-or-later"
 :itonami.blueprint/social-impact [:worker-safety :electrical-safety :product-safety]
 :itonami.blueprint/governor :wiring-devices-plant-operations-governor
 :itonami.blueprint/robotics true
 :itonami.blueprint/required-technologies [:robotics :identity :forms :dmn :bpmn :audit-ledger :eda :cae]
 :itonami.blueprint/status :public-oss
 :itonami.blueprint/maturity :implemented
 :itonami.blueprint/implemented-slice
 "WiringDeviceAdvisor ⊣ Wiring Devices Plant Operations Governor,
 langgraph-clj StateGraph, append-only audit ledger. A plant OPERATIONS
 COORDINATION actor for ISIC 2733 (manufacture of wiring devices --
 switches, socket-outlets, plugs, junction boxes: molding of device
 housings, contact/terminal assembly, and end-of-line test lines
 producing finished units of these product families) -- not direct
 molding/assembly/test-line-equipment control authority and not
 electrical-safety-certification authority (e.g. UL/CE/IEC compliance
 mark). Four ops (`:log-production-batch` / `:schedule-maintenance` /
 `:flag-safety-concern` / `:coordinate-shipment`), all `:effect
 :propose` only. Twelve concrete governor checks elaborate this
 blueprint's four HARD invariants: propose-only effect, closed op
 allowlist, closed proposal-effect allowlist (no direct
 molding/assembly/test-line-equipment control), permanent
 equipment-actuate block, permanent safety-certification-authority
 block (this actor never self-issues an electrical-safety compliance
 mark), independent equipment verification/registration before
 maintenance scheduling, independent batch verification/registration
 before shipment coordination, independent shipment-quantity recompute
 against the batch's own logged production quantity, double-schedule
 guard, product-type validation, contact-resistance plausibility
 validation, and defect-rate plausibility validation. Safety-concern
 flagging (contact-overheating/electrical-safety/dielectric-withstand-
 test-hazard) ALWAYS escalates to a human plant supervisor;
 `:log-production-batch` is the only op eligible to auto-commit, and
 only at phase 3 when governor-clean."}
